acks low behind A-Zhi as it runs.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nThe faint scurrying sound of A-Zhi's paws on packed dirt.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nNone.\n"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "id": 36, "type": "Text Multiline", "properties": {"cnr_id": "was-node-suite-comfyui", "ver": "fe7e0884aaf0188248d9abf1e500f5116097fec1", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "version": "7.0.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Text Multiline"}, "order": 13, "widgets_values_named": {"text": "subject_definitions:\n<Subject 3> is A-Zhi, the round grey hamster-like rat in <Picture 2>, with wet grey fur over a white belly, large round amber eyes, a pink nose, long fine whiskers, a notched right ear, spiky wet hair tuft on top of its head, a thick yellow hemp rope around its neck strung with a bronze square-holed coin at its chest. Its tail fades from grey to brown at the tip, with the last section singed and burnt black. The celadon flask is slung at its side.\n<Picture 2> is the character-design reference for <Subject 3>.\n\nsummary:\n[reference generation] The target video shows A-Zhi running fast along the wall in the pitch-dark ancient west market street. No light sources.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 3> (appears throughout [Shot 20]): fully_preserved.\n<Picture 2> (character-design reference): fully_preserved.\n\ndetailed_description:\nThe target video uses a 3D Eastern fantasy animation-film style with PBR physically based rendering, 8K ultra-high definition. The entire scene has no light source of any kind: no moonlight, no starlight, no candlelight, no lantern light, no ambient light. All paper lanterns under the eaves are old and extinguished for years—blackened wicks, dusty dark red paper, not lit. The sky is blue-black, roof tiles are dark blue, the ground is deep blue-grey. Overall cool blue tone, low brightness, low saturation. All surfaces are matte, no reflections, no highlights. Forbidden: any glowing object, glow, moonlight, highlights, warm colors, firelight. No subtitles.\n[Shot 20] At 00:00.000, a low-angle shot. A-Zhi runs fast along the wall base of the dark ancient street. Its four paws alternate in a scurrying run, body bobbing slightly with each stride, the celadon flask swinging gently at its hip. The bronze coin hangs from its neck rope. The camera tracks low behind A-Zhi as it runs.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nThe faint scurrying sound of A-Zhi's paws on packed dirt.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nNone.\n"}}], "extra": {"links_added_by_ue": [], "VHS_KeepIntermediate": true, "ue_links": [], "VHS_MetadataImage": true, "pixaromaGroups": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "VHS_latentpreviewrate": 0, "frontendVersion": "1.52.7", "VHS_latentpreview": false, "ds": {"offset": [284.08523716136125, -1614.864765648063], "scale": 0.5989500000000019}}, "groups": [{"color": "#3f789e", "flags": {}, "id": 1, "title": "输入区", "bounding": [34.89971069334206, 1658.1199069320555, 1626.330357890883, 783.9733320035302]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "flags": {}, "id": 2, "title": "模型加载区", "bounding": [-105.74387605629745, 788.3062860691957, 697.044151397705, 566.8939093214102]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "flags": {}, "id": 3, "title": "运行区", "bounding": [908.5178289037353, 501.20939194544536, 1983.835905345568, 877.1713745346107]}], "links": [[1, 1, 0, 8, 0, "MODEL"], [2, 8, 0, 9, 0, "MODEL"], [3, 9, 0, 5, 0, "MODEL"], [4, 5, 0, 10, 0, "MODEL"], [5, 10, 0, 12, 0, "MODEL"], [6, 12, 0, 14, 0, "MODEL"], [7, 7, 0, 14, 1, "CONDITIONING"], [8, 13, 0, 20, 0, "NOISE"], [9, 14, 0, 20, 1, "GUIDER"], [10, 16, 0, 20, 2, "SAMPLER"], [12, 12, 0, 17, 0, "MODEL"], [13, 17, 0, 19, 0, "SIGMAS"], [14, 19, 0, 20, 3, "SIGMAS"], [15, 20, 0, 21, 0, "LATENT"], [17, 21, 0, 23, 0, "IMAGE"], [18, 23, 0, 25, 0, "IMAGE"], [19, 20, 0, 22, 0, "LATENT"], [20, 22, 0, 24, 0, "AUDIO"], [21, 24, 0, 25, 1, "AUDIO"], [22, 4, 0, 21, 1, "VAE"], [23, 37, 0, 22, 1, "VAE"], [28, 26, 0, 41, 0, "IMAGE"], [